":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/35d3997540a317df3e0796bdcedc26b3.avif?t=1772702171\" width=864 height=1280 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cubic Cosmos combines roguelike deck building with fast-paced tower defense gameplay. Build an unstoppable army of pawns, chain together massive combos, and enjoy endless possibilities!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mix and Match Countless Exciting Strategies</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create an army of unstoppable pawns and build up their attributes to beat down the strongest of bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/21b8770e374fdd91dbefc35653f780f2.poster.avif?t=1772702171\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/21b8770e374fdd91dbefc35653f780f2.webm?t=1772702171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/21b8770e374fdd91dbefc35653f780f2.mp4?t=1772702171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together abilities to unleash awesome combos, take endless turns, and deal massive damage... anything is possible!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up pawns to unlock incredible synergies and clear whole battlefields in a single shot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/ea38a81dcab1074310ff477b3a6d2ed7.poster.avif?t=1772702171\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/ea38a81dcab1074310ff477b3a6d2ed7.webm?t=1772702171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/ea38a81dcab1074310ff477b3a6d2ed7.mp4?t=1772702171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build an Unbeatable Deck</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine cards and Relics to build an unstoppable deck.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 200+ cards, create lethal combinations that are unique to you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique effect combos with 40+ equippable Relics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear runs to unlock 9 different heroes with unique abilities.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of random events make each run a new adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/460cc3d0a6a51d077abc8f5d220b5136.poster.avif?t=1772702171\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/460cc3d0a6a51d077abc8f5d220b5136.webm?t=1772702171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/460cc3d0a6a51d077abc8f5d220b5136.mp4?t=1772702171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rise to the Challenge in Multiple Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Adventures: With fixed and random boss fights and daily challenges, you'll find new thrills in every run!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scaling Difficulty: Prove yourself in 10+ difficulty levels and emerge stronger than ever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastery Mode: Are you a true master of the cosmos? Put your perfectly crafted deck to the test in this high-pressure game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/9ece4df3769ced70f9b0b24a100d14aa.poster.avif?t=1772702171\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/9ece4df3769ced70f9b0b24a100d14aa.webm?t=1772702171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/9ece4df3769ced70f9b0b24a100d14aa.mp4?t=1772702171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Share Pawns and Matches With One Click</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doll Code System: Share your beloved pawns with the world and let them marvel at your strength!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match Share: Generate a Battle Code to share your best moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/674f377e9c1b83eb56374b075e32aa6d.poster.avif?t=1772702171\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/674f377e9c1b83eb56374b075e32aa6d.webm?t=1772702171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/674